<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-GMexico, Sanluis.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-GMexico, Sanluis.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Lyonnais reiterated its buy rating on Mexican mining firms Corporacion Industrial Sanluis SA and Grupo Mexico SA.</p>
<p>-- Analyst David Bodenberg raised his 1996 earnings estimate for Sanluis to 5.35 pesos from 5.11 pesos, but reduced his 1997 earnings estimate for the company to 4.62 pesos from 5.02 pesos.</p>
<p>-- He added that Grupo Mexico is his company's preferred buy in the Latin America mining sector.  &quot;Stock price has scarcely yet reflected the favorable turnaround since late summer in the copper price,&quot; he wrote.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
